\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15.2}{\ignorespaces A one-month at-the-money covered call against the index alone, using the worked example's prices. The call premium of \$2.47 caps the gain and cushions the loss by the same amount, so the covered call keeps almost all of the index's downside.}}{198}{figure.caption.62}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:14-cc}{{15.2}{198}{A one-month at-the-money covered call against the index alone, using the worked example's prices. The call premium of \$2.47 caps the gain and cushions the loss by the same amount, so the covered call keeps almost all of the index's downside}{figure.caption.62}{}}
